    "text": "<h3>My First Concert! </h3>This was my first concert ever and it really set the bar high. It was my first time at Metlife Stadium too and honestly, it was the perfect venue for Travis Scott. The stadium was absolutely packed and the energy was insane, which was surprising given that this took place on a Wednesday. I was a little taken aback at how young so many of the fans were (and slightly impressed that they made it out here on a school night) but I still had a blast! My only regret is not lining up for the Slingshot ride in the middle of the pit. <br /><br />Even though I didn't have any prior concerts to compare this one to, I could tell how special this night was. Travis Scott brought out Playboi Carti, Future, and Sheck Wes. In between playing <i>FE!N</i> seven times, he also performed <i>Apple Pie</i>, making this the first live performance since 2016.",
