    "text": "<h3>In the Aftermath of the Kendrick/Drake Beef</h3> Around this time last year, Drake had released <i>The Heart Part 6</i> right after Kendrick's <i>Not Like Us</i>.  Following this was Kendrick's Juneteenth concert at The Kia Forum, the release of his album GNX, and then his performance at the Super Bowl LIX Halftime Show. I was curious whether after all this, he would address the beef directly during this concert. I think I got my answer when after Kendrick performed <i>euphoria</i>, SZA performed her verse from <i>Rich Baby Daddy</i>, featuring Drake. At the end of the day, business is business. And rap beef drives streaming and engagement, no matter the outcome.",
